# A line holding a tab (case 04).
-- input.cnf.esc --
[mydumper]\n\t\nthreads=4\n
-- fixed.cnf --
[mydumper]

threads=4
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:2 error MDL102[whitespace-only-line] line contains only whitespace: mydumper's pre-processor turns it into `\t= 1`, a key/value pair with an empty key (GLib: Key file contains line “\t= 1” which is not a key-value pair, group, or comment)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
  fix (safe): Remove the whitespace
